WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.350
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.350
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:09.230
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:09.230
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:22.040
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:22.040
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.210
The precious arms

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.210
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:32.220
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:32.220
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:39.560
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:39.560
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:49.020
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:49.020
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:56.280
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:56.280
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:04.210
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:04.210
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.500
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.500
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.170
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.170
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:19.350
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:19.350
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.680
This love...

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.680
Omoi wo

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.690
Jessica! Jessica!

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:48.040
Yvon... You and I will be together...

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.000
forev...

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.760
JESSICA!

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:16.780
Detective! We've lost communication with Pod #3.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.200
The reserve line doesn't work either!

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.700
Send the closest pod to the scene immediately!

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:26.700
In The Mist

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.580
Somebody, help me...

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:38.970
Kurau...

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.320
I've obtained information regarding the girl's identity.

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.450
Her name is Jessica Lundgren.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:04.080
Her parents worked at the
Rynax Energy Plant on the Moon,

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.160
and they both died during that accident.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:12.210
Jessica happened to be at the scene,
but was the only one to survive.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.630
I see...

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:18.800
She showed no signs of the Rynax reaction
and so was sent back to this village.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.590
But then to have that happen...

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:24.800
That boy...

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.430
Who exactly is that boy?

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.810
Please tell me, Inspector!

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:35.230
I cannot tell you. I've already told you that.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:36.020
But...

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.110
If I tell you, it will endanger your position too.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.530
It's better that you don't know.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.450
We must avoid spreading further damage.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.410
Ayaka, you will go join the search.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.000
Yes, sir.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.060
Yvon...

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.280
Yvon... Have some water...

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.500
Jessica...

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.210
Jessica! Jessica!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.780
It's okay. He's sleeping now.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:21.090
He was calling out someone's name, wasn't he?

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.800
Over and over again...

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.170
Yeah.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.550
Who is Jessica?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:31.430
I don't know, but... I felt it...

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.430
The sadness of losing a Pair.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:40.110
So Yvon did find his Pair...

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.820
But...

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:49.820
it's okay...

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:51.740
it's okay...

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.630
Do you think the GPO is still after Yvon?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:02.710
Probably.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.470
We should try to escape to another place as soon as we can,

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.880
but we can't move Yvon right now.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.260
That's true.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:14.720
Christmas, I'm going to Uncle Frank's.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.770
I'm sure they're worried.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.810
I'll be right back, so please take care of Yvon.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.440
Okay... I will.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.360
Where am I?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.330
I can't remember! Think!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.160
What happened? What happened?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.800
Jessica...

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.270
Jessica!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.850
Jessica! Jessica!

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.940
Jessica!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.150
Why did you do such a thing?

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.410
Do you know what you've done?

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:55.830
Kurau!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.490
Kleine.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:08:00.750
But isn't the GPO after that boy?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.290
By hiding him, it puts you at risk too!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.630
Kurau understands that... Right?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.460
I couldn't leave him alone...

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:12.840
I just couldn't...

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:16.260
Because we've been chased down before too.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:22.310
Kurau, can you come back here with him?

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.480
But if I do, then...

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.360
I know.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:32.780
But the GPO has finished searching this area.
It should be safe now.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.110
Bring him over.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.540
Don't take any chances, okay?

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:40.580
Okay.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:47.460
To me, you're the precious daughter
that my sister left behind.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.340
And so is Christmas.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.090
Aunt Kleine...

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.840
Kleine.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.190
All done!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:13.490
Hot, hot chocolate!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.280
Steaming hot chocolate!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.280
Yvon!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:21.790
Hmm?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.800
Yvon!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.300
Yvon!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:40.300
He seemed to be in so much pain, where did he go?

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.280
It's pitch black.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:58.610
So the Ryna sapien lurks somewhere in this forest.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.910
If I tell you, it will endanger your position too.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.000
It's better that you don't know.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.080
What does he mean by that?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.040
What's going on?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.500
Ayaka...

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.210
The infrared sensors aren't
picking anything up either.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.550
What do you want to do?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.220
Let's get off.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.300
Let's go.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.430
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:35.570
What on Earth is Inspector Wong hiding?

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.530
Ayaka...

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:42.410
Wouldn't it be better to wait till morning and
gather more people to comb the mountain?

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.540
Ayaka, what's wrong?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.750
Wait up!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.300
You go ask headquarters for reinforcement!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.090
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.850
I'm back, Christmas!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.350
Christmas...

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.430
Chocolate?

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.690
Kurau?!

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.400
So you're alive...

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.360
What did you do with Christmas and Yvon?

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.530
Yvon?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.990
So you were with him too?

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.160
So you guys didn't take them away?

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:15.670
I don't know. But who would've
thought you were alive?

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.880
Why are you after the Rynax?

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.300
Why?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.130
Do you have any idea how many people
Ryna sapiens have killed?

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.390
So many, including those who worked for me!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:30.520
We can't let you roam free.
You Ryna sapiens are dangerous!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.100
If that's the case, then why?

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.650
Why did you force Rynax into Yvon's body? Why?!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.230
What are you talking about?

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.530
It's unforgivable...

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:42.030
Making both humans and Rynax suffer...

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.280
And for what?

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:45.910
For what?!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:49.410
Making humans suffer? What do you mean?

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:55.210
You don't know? You don't know anything?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.380
Don't change the subject!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:02.720
Sorry, but I don't have time to deal
with you right now.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.090
Wait!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.680
Kurau!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:13.100
Expand the search area to a 20km radius.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.310
Roger. We'll go up north along the valley.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.940
Inspector, Detective Ayaka is on the line.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:19.980
What's the matter?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.690
Kurau... Kurau's alive!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:23.530
What?!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:27.780
No... Unfortunately, she got away.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:31.290
It seems the boy and Christmas were also here till a moment ago.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.660
I see... I'll send a pod over right away.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:35.500
Yes, sir.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.090
The thing Inspector Wong was hiding...

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.180
Is that what Kurau was talking about?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.220
Christmas...

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.060
Yvon...

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.500
I can't see anything...

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.130
I wanted to go somewhere...

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.220
But I didn't even know where to go...

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.640
In this vast world... Where to go...

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.520
Let's go back... To Kurau.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.020
That's not where I belong.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.320
Kurau wants to help you.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:52.070
Help? How can she help me?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.580
A Rynax can't live without its Pair.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:58.870
You should know that!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.630
Sorry... Yvon.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:10.590
I can't be your Pair... I'm sorry.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.140
I'm getting closer!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:18.350
Christmas... Yvon... Please be safe.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.690
Yvon, your hand...

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.950
It seems to spread every time I use my powers.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:34.620
I'm probably going to disappear...

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.540
But that's okay.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:44.040
Even if I stay in this world,
I'm all alone anyway.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.340
No!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:49.460
I can return you to the world you came from.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:53.510
Please... don't say that you'll disappear...

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.220
The world I came from...

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:58.600
Is Jessica there?

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.650
But... But...

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:30.420
If I disappear, I wonder if I'll forget about Jessica?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.800
When I go back to the world I came from,

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.010
will I still be able to remember Jessica?

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.720
Yvon?

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.850
Jessica was all alone.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:50.230
If I disappear, then she'll be all alone again.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:55.160
But as long as I remember her,
Jessica can be with me...

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.320
Yvon...

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:02.450
I'll go back to the world I came from...

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.000
it's those guys again!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.050
No matter where I go, they hunt me down.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.220
If they'd never come, then Jessica would be...

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:18.260
They killed Jessica!

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.600
No!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.350
You go hide somewhere!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.060
Yvon!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.600
Target spotted! He's coming towards us!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.060
Confirmed.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.730
Draw him towards you, then irradiate with the AR System.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:32.610
Roger.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.500
Yvon!

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.080
Christmas... Stay hidden!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.630
Yvon!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:51.670
Christmas!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.920
Kurau! Help Yvon!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.220
He's gonna disappear!
At this rate, he's gonna disappear!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:02.350
H-Headquarters! Another Ryna sapien!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.020
Kurau!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.900
Kurau! She's come to help him?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:23.700
Yvon!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.420
Yvon!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.170
I did it, Jessica...

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.880
I beat those guys...

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.010
Yvon!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.970
Kurau...

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.760
I had a Pair too.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.180
Her name was Jessica.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.100
Kurau, I'm sorry.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.810
I did some terrible things to you.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.610
Yvon!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.610
Kurau... Christmas...

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.490
I'm sorry...

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.660
Jessica...

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.240
I don't want to forget you...

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:07.450
I don't want to forget...

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.960
Yvon! NO!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.920
No... No! Don't disappear!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.010
Don't disappear...

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.190
Annihilated...

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:35.980
Yvon...

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.320
Christmas!

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:44.950
Yvon... Yvon... Yvon... Yvon...

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.670
Christmas!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.430
Rynax are... pouring out...

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:10.100
ALL UNITS, RETREAT!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:17.290
Yvon was trying to go back...

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.170
Back to the world he came from!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:23.550
The world he came from?

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.470
And yet... Why?

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:26.590
Why?

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.840
What are you talking about?

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:34.890
Fire.

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.380
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.380
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:23.690
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:23.690
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.050
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.050
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.270
Moonlight

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.270
Moonlight

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.870
Next Episode

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:15.620
Rynax were happy to come out into this world...

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:19.210
Even though there are lots of dangers in this world...

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:23.080
But they didn't care they were just happy to come out.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.880
The Visitor
